abstract: >-
  Analysis code accompanying a criterion-explicit reproducibility study of matrix-remodelling
  candidate genes in osteoarthritis synovium. It covers per-cohort differential expression,
  merged effects and leave-one-cohort-out re-ranking, single-cell localisation, the cross-linker
  family under one criterion framework, and cis-eQTL Mendelian randomisation checks.
